From 774390e505428fd051d8a96c5210d7ae54550098 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ricky112-creator <rickywhite254@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:56:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix WhatsApp/dashboard sync, close auth gaps, stay inside
 free-tier limits

WhatsApp sync (no Cloud API): dashboard order is recorded first (awaited, retried,
honest failure banner), WhatsApp carries the same short order code (#K7Q2M); phone
required (except table-QR); new unconfirmed/cancelled statuses with staff Confirm/
Cancel, one-tap Call/WhatsApp/pin on each card; recovery Send-on-WhatsApp button on
/track; reservations without items now recorded; delivery pin sent to the server.

Security: ?tap= no longer bypasses auth on /api/updates (tap counts moved from KV to
D1, rate limited); shared constant-time auth with wrong-code lockout; escape custom
menu names; staff codes unbiased 10 chars; phone/address/pin wiped after 30 days.

Free-tier: _routes.json keeps static files out of Functions; gallery thumbnails +
Cache API + revisioned URLs; calmer polling; sales count only done orders; global
order flood cap; live orders never trimmed.

Housekeeping: noindex headers instead of robots Disallow, SETUP.md, README fixes.
